CHIP     LCD01 EPX8160QC208

; This is the source file for the EPX8160QC208 Demo Board.  Flashing
; and scrolling LCD displays can be created by modifying the
; RAM_DEFAULTS section, below.

;---------------------------------- PIN Declarations ---------------


; Global pins
PIN   IN0         /RESET  INPUT
PIN   IN2         /STEP   INPUT
; NODE  IO28         PO_RESET_

