; Start of global STRING definitions

; The following strings are used to initialize locations in the SRAM
; to send various commands to the LCD.

STRING LCD_function '0x038' ; LCD Function Set - 8 bit I/F, Dual line
STRING LCD_clear    '0x001' ; LCD Display Clear (1.64 ms)
STRING LCD_entry    '0x006' ; LCD Entry Mode, inc dd adrs, no shift
STRING LCD_display  '0x00C' ; LCD Display on & Cursor off

; The following strings are used to initialize locations in the SRAM
; to Data_to_LCD commands.  These commands are used when no time
; delay is needed between characters; e.g., a flashing display.

